OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy but generally dry through the
OL,7,Fevening, with the odd patch of mist
OL,8,Fdeveloping overnight. Cloud building
OL,9,Fby dawn with showers developing into
OL,10,Fthe morning. Mild, and feeling very
OL,11,Fmuggy across the region.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cloudy start with a band
OL,14,Fof heavy, potentially thundery showers
OL,15,Fmoving across the area. Showers clear
OL,16,Fto the north to leave a dry and partly
OL,17,Fcloudy afternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
